// REQUIRES: long
// P04.04: lowering stays near-linear for tens of thousands of package
// variables in init order, thousands of checked statements and thousands of
// local types (GIRStressLong; see core-stress.long.test).
// RUN: timeout 300 %gopp_unit_tests --gtest_also_run_disabled_tests --gtest_filter='GIRStressLong.DISABLED_LoweringGlobalsInInitOrder:GIRStressLong.DISABLED_LoweringManyCheckedStatements:GIRStressLong.DISABLED_LoweringManyLocalTypes'
